- Melee
- Lightsaber (Staff/Duals/Cyan)
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- Blaster Defense (1)
-- Blaster Deflect (1)
-- 135% Spec Dmg mult
-- Saber Throw (2) ^3[CS1]

